1
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:12,840
Yongmei.

2
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,280
Yongmei.

3
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,160
Hurry up,

4
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,600
the car is back.

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,480
Coming.

6
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,360
Come on,

7
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:21,960
slow down.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,840
I got you.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,060
Look at you,

10
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,520
about to be a mother

11
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,440
and still so clumsy.

12
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,240
You have no idea.

13
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,560
The baby

14
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,320
is getting so big.

15
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:37,400
I'm losing my balance when I walk.

16
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,920
I feel like I could
fall forward at any moment.

17
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,520
Look.

18
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,160
This tricycle

19
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,560
is quite new.

20
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,600
Sure is.

21
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:58,440
Yongmei,

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,330
you look like you've gotten bigger again.

23
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:04,760
I bet

24
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,600
it's a naughty boy.

25
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:08,760
He's not even born yet,

26
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:11,160
and he's already giving
his mom a hard time.

27
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:12,810
You little brat.

28
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,080
Just wait till you come out

29
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:15,039
and see how your dad

30
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:15,900
deals with you.

31
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:19,250
Yongmei, what's wrong?

32
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,480
He kicked me.

33
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,720
He must have heard you talking about him

34
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:25,720
and got upset.

35
00:01:25,720 --> 00:01:26,920
He gave me a hard kick.

36
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,600
This little guy has good ears.

37
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:31,450
Hey, little guy,

38
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,640
Daddy was just

39
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:34,520
joking with you.

40
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:36,440
When you're born,

41
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,280
Daddy promises

42
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,840
not to lay a finger on you.

43
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:40,640
I'll love you

44
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,570
and cherish you.

45
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:44,800
Come on, Yongmei,

46
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,640
get in the car.

47
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,700
Let's go for a spin.

48
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,479
Is that okay?

49
00:01:49,479 --> 00:01:50,200
Why wouldn't it be?

50
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,080
It's our car.

51
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,660
We can go wherever we want.

52
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:55,759
Forget it.

53
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,960
It was bought mainly for you

54
00:01:57,960 --> 00:02:00,020
to use for work and buying materials,

55
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,560
not to drive me around.

56
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:04,000
But

57
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:05,920
my dad went to a lot of trouble

58
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,680
for this little car.

59
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,120
Work hard.

60
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,979
Don't let his efforts go to waste.

61
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,000
Look at you.

62
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,890
You pull a long face
whenever I mention my dad.

63
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,280
He looked down on you at first

64
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,760
and absolutely refused
to let us be together.

65
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,079
But look at him now.

66
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:32,079
Isn't he helping us out in every way?

67
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,079
Just work hard.

68
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:35,840
When you become a big boss,

69
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,320
who would dare to look down on us?

70
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:42,440
As they say,
a hero's background doesn't matter.

71
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:43,160
Got it?

72
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,600
When I get rich...

73
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:50,160
Right,

74
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,640
when you get rich.

75
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,160
Once you're rich,

76
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,680
you can go to my family's house

77
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,480
and show off.

78
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,960
Make them see clearly

79
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,210
that I, Yan Yongmei,

80
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:00,160
didn't choose the wrong man.

81
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,080
And then?

82
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,720
You can find a few

83
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,600
fathers-in-law who suck up to you,

84
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,530
and take three or five concubines.

85
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,960
Turn your life around completely,

86
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,100
how about that?

87
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,840
As if that would work.

88
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,460
Three or five concubines?

89
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,440
By then...

90
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:24,760
if I even glance at another girl,

91
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:25,920
or even a female dog,

92
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:26,560
you'd probably

93
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,760
pull my ears off.

94
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,800
Am I that petty?

95
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:35,280
Come on, please get in.

96
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,800
Let's get in!

97
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:37,340
Come on,

98
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,320
give me a hand.

99
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:38,880
Careful.

100
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:39,560
Okay.

101
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:43,440
Let's take a ride in our new car!

102
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:47,320
Folks, please make way.

103
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:50,600
Step back, Yongmei is driving.

104
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,840
Let's go!

105
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:57,079
The sun, the sun is like a golden lock.

106
00:03:57,079 --> 00:04:00,320
The moon is like a silver lock.

107
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,200
Busy, busy, busy.

108
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,690
That's all you know.

109
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,640
My daughter died on the operating table,

110
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,680
and she didn't even

111
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,210
get to see you one last time.

112
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,900
Why are you pulling me?

113
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,360
I told you

114
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,520
she shouldn't have married him.

115
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,240
Now look.

116
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,440
She didn't have a single good day

117
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,080
and ended up losing her life.

118
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:44,360
Mom,

119
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,040
it's my fault.

120
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,360
I don't know

121
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,600
how this could have happened.

122
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:53,760
I

123
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,130
really had something to do that night.

124
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,640
Save it.

125
00:04:58,040 --> 00:05:00,300
Who knows where you were fooling around.

126
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,130
We're taking

127
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,400
the child.

128
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,880
You don't need to worry about it.

129
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,540
From now on,

130
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,370
you can marry whoever you want.

131
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,490
It has nothing to do with us.

132
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,520
Mom,

133
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,720
I'm begging you.

134
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,040
Please leave the child with me.

135
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:15,700
This is the last connection
I have with Yongmei.

136
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,280
Really, I won't remarry.

137
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,320
I swear,

138
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,000
I, Gao Yuhai,

139
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,560
will never remarry.

140
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,720
If I ever remarry,

141
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,800
may I be struck

142
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:24,960
by lightning.

143
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:26,880
Yuhai,

144
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,200
we understand

145
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,520
you.

146
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:30,170
Just take

147
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:32,159
good care of the child.

148
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,840
If you have any difficulties
in the future,

149
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,880
tell us.

150
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,760
We're still family.

151
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:37,680
Okay, Mom.

152
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,940
Who's family with him?

153
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,240
Let's go.

154
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,280
Get up.

155
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,040
Get in the car.

156
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,640
Yongmei,

157
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,800
it was about to rain that day.

158
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:54,159
Everyone was running home,

159
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,450
but there was one person

160
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,920
silently

161
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,560
following me.

162
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,120
Okay.

163
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,840
That wasn't the first day

164
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,370
I noticed him following me.

165
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,640
For a long time,

166
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,400
I felt

167
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:42,080
a pair of eyes peeping at me.

168
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,880
When I was shopping,

169
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,480
I could feel someone behind me.

170
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,340
When I was dancing on the rooftop,

171
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,890
I could also feel someone watching me.

172
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:57,560
But for over a year,

173
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,820
I realized that person meant no harm.

174
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,610
So I didn't think much of it.

175
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:05,920
You might ask

176
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:09,170
if I was afraid of
that person finding out.

177
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,680
I can tell you,

178
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:13,640
I wasn't.

179
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:17,490
Because I was already prepared

180
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:20,000
to commit suicide

181
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,660
after running over Gao Yuhai.

182
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:27,040
Why would someone
who's decided to commit suicide

183
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:28,960
fear being reported?

184
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,520
I thought

185
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,760
everything would go as planned.

186
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,760
I would run over Gao Yuhai,

187
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,880
then poison myself.

188
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,680
Ashes to ashes,

189
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,880
dust to dust.

190
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,290
It would all be over.

191
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,400
But I didn't expect

192
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,520
Xiao Ze to show up,

193
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,360
pose as a traffic cop,

194
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:00,480
and wipe the scene clean.

195
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,560
You all know

196
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,460
what happened after that.

197
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:07,640
Yayan,

198
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,320
I don't blame you

199
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:11,480
for taking Song Yanfei away.

200
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:14,090
You can help him achieve his dream.

201
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,580
He was right to choose you.

202
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:19,370
Actually, I'm the one who wronged you.

203
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,560
I hit and killed your father.

204
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,600
Not only did you not blame me,

205
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,880
but you never even suspected me.

206
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,160
I owe you.

207
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,770
Consider that music box

208
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:36,000
my compensation to you.

209
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,600
Like I said,

210
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,640
let's leave everything to fate.

211
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:45,320
Well,

212
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,620
I've said everything I wanted to say.

213
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,280
I have no regrets now.

214
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,120
Captain Li,

215
00:09:58,640 --> 00:09:59,720
Song Yanfei,

216
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,360
Yayan,

217
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:05,840
Goodbye.

218
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:43,800
Police investigation shows that

219
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,120
Shen Xi

220
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:46,780
intentionally

221
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:49,000
drove her car into Gao Yuhai,

222
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,480
causing his death.

223
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:53,820
Her actions constitute
intentional homicide.

224
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,260
But since she has committed suicide,

225
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,640
we cannot hold her criminally liable.

226
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:01,680
So I will report this
truthfully to my superiors.

227
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:05,960
As his family,

228
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:08,520
do you have anything else to say?

229
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,440
Gao Yuhai

230
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,880
got what he deserved.

231
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:33,010
Then this case is clear.

232
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:36,620
If you have no further questions,

233
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:38,060
we will close the case.

234
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,920
Okay. Thank you, Captain Li.

235
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:46,480
I

236
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,280
have one last question.

237
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,760
I need a reasonable explanation

238
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:52,280
from you two.

239
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,960
Especially you.

240
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,320
Go ahead.

241
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:59,040
Don't you have anything to explain

242
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,240
about that tricycle parked by the road,

243
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,800
blocking your father's way?

244
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,360
Captain Li,

245
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,980
what does the tricycle

246
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:08,560
have to do with Yayan?

247
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,720
If it has nothing to do with Ms. Gao,

248
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:15,120
then why did you go
to the recycling station

249
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,780
and buy it back at a high price?

250
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,400
Officer

251
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:21,520
Li,

252
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,280
welcome.

253
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,120
Hello.

254
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:24,720
Officers,

255
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,840
thanks for your hard work.

256
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,120
Come inside for some tea.

257
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,200
Tea can wait.

258
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,200
Let's talk about the situation first.

259
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,680
We didn't process the car

260
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:32,920
the day it was delivered.

261
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,280
As per your request,

262
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:36,680
we waited three days before processing it.

263
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,280
That was

264
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,080
just yesterday.

265
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,120
Coincidentally,

266
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:43,640
just as we were about to process it,

267
00:12:43,760 --> 00:12:45,240
someone showed up.

268
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,480
Wait a minute.

269
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:56,720
Can I help you?

270
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,290
I want to buy this tricycle.

271
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:00,720
We handed it all over

272
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,640
to the state as a contribution,
including the cost.

273
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,480
That's very noble of you, boss.

274
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:07,040
It's a lot. Captain Li, please count it.

275
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:09,720
This money

276
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,920
is a bit unusual,

277
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,360
but it's fine.

278
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:13,920
Cooperating with us

279
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:14,960
and reporting promptly

280
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,640
already makes you good,
law-abiding citizens.

281
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,770
Give it back to them.

282
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,240
Here you go.

283
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:22,200
Boss,

284
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,680
can we take a look
at yesterday's surveillance footage?

285
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:25,520
No problem.

286
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:26,850
It's already prepared.

287
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,200
Do you have a copy

288
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,440
of this surveillance footage?

289
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:39,170
I've already copied it for you.

290
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,520
Okay, thank you.

291
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:44,360
We'll head out then.

292
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,040
Wait, officers.

293
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,400
Stay for a quick meal.

294
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,840
We've already prepared everything.

295
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,920
We'll pass on the meal.

296
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,250
We still have work to do.

297
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:53,840
Also,

298
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,240
don't tell anyone

299
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:56,760
about our investigation here.

300
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:57,480
Sure, sure.

301
00:13:59,160 --> 00:13:59,890
I'm leaving,

302
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:01,820
or it's a leak of information.

303
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:04,520
Goodbye.

304
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,200
Officers,

305
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:05,960
bye.

306
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:06,880
Go back.

307
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:10,440
I knew early on

308
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:13,200
that Gao Yayan definitely
recognized that tricycle.

309
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:13,720
Early?

310
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:14,840
How early?

311
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,960
The day she came to do the paperwork,

312
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,040
as soon as she entered the hall,

313
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:20,720
she kept staring at that tricycle.

314
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,920
Captain Li even asked her at the time,

315
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:23,800
saying, "Have you seen
this tricycle before?"

316
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:26,660
She hesitated for a while
before saying she hadn't.

317
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,240
Tong Wenming.

318
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:43,880
What,

319
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:46,120
do you know this tricycle?

320
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,080
No wonder you

321
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:52,520
applied to use this vehicle as bait.

322
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:54,880
So are we investigating

323
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,200
Gao Yayan next?

324
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,120
It's not the time yet.

325
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,000
Let's wait.

326
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,400
Wait until when, Captain Li?

327
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:04,240
Until this vehicle is
thoroughly investigated,

328
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:06,160
and everyone surfaces.

329
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,450
Understood. Drive.

330
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:19,040
You said you've never seen this tricycle,

331
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:20,640
right?

332
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:23,920
You lied.

333
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,040
Why did you lie?

